# The world data extract_world.py reads out of the game, the sheet render_map.py draws from it, and the
# map stitch_map.py joins from the game's own pictures.
work/
# The map textures build_layer.py draws from them; the archetype fragments beside them are kept.
layer/mods/levels/
layer/mods/worlds/world1/mapcompass*.xbt
layer/mods/graphics/
# The plugin's build tree, and the DLL the layer only carries.
out/
layer/plugins/map-overhaul/MapOverhaul.dll
__pycache__/
